A/B autoboot (mt7987 / R4-Lite): fast boot + space-to-stop instead of the menu.

Mirror of bpi-r4 z01 for R4-Lite's three media defconfigs (emmc/sd/snand).
Upstream mt7987 ships only CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW (no BOOTDELAY / KEYED),
so replace it with BOOTDELAY=1 + AUTOBOOT_KEYED + AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR (space)
for an unattended 1s boot interruptible from serial. z02 (bootcount) builds
on the AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR line this adds.

--- a/configs/mt7987a_bpi-r4-lite-emmc_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7987a_bpi-r4-lite-emmc_defconfig
@@ -16,7 +16,9 @@
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_CLOCK=40000000
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="mt7987a-bpi-r4-lite-emmc"
 CONFIG_SYS_CBSIZE=512
 CONFIG_SYS_PBSIZE=1049
--- a/configs/mt7987a_bpi-r4-lite-sd_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7987a_bpi-r4-lite-sd_defconfig
@@ -16,7 +16,9 @@
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_CLOCK=40000000
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="mt7987a-bpi-r4-lite-sd"
 CONFIG_SYS_CBSIZE=512
 CONFIG_SYS_PBSIZE=1049
--- a/configs/mt7987a_bpi-r4-lite-snand_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7987a_bpi-r4-lite-snand_defconfig
@@ -16,7 +16,9 @@
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_CLOCK=40000000
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="mt7987a-bpi-r4-lite-emmc-spim-nand"
 CONFIG_SYS_CBSIZE=512
 CONFIG_SYS_PBSIZE=1049
